<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS4.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.4 Accuracy and Efficiency ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ ReFIne: A Framework for Trustworthy Large Reasoning Models with Reliability, Faithfulness, and Interpretability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Efficiency (Reasoning Length).</span></a></li>
