</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS2" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ ReFIne: A Framework for Trustworthy Large Reasoning Models with Reliability, Faithfulness, and Interpretability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.2 </span>Prompting QwQ-32B to Judge Reasoning Readability</span></a></li>
