</figure>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Commitment faithfulness. For each dataset, we report the fraction of traces where <span id="S4.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;think&gt;</span> strictly follows <span id="S4.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;understanding&gt;</span> / <span id="S4.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;facts&gt;</span> / <span id="S4.T3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;plan&gt;</span>.</figcaption>
