<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>AUROC; higher is better. <span id="S4.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">Plain</span> on AIME-2024 is marked in <span id="S4.T5.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span> since it rarely outputs confidence, making its AUROC unreliable.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T5.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T5.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
