<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="Pt1" class="ltx_part">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_part"></h2>

<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h3>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Exact Prompts Used for Collecting SFT Data</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the iterative procedure to generate SFT data to train <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ReFIne</span> and exact prompts used to elicit each section. We query <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen3-8B</span> <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">sequentially</em> in the order shown in Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2 Trustworthy Reasoning: Definition and Motivation ‣ ReFIne: A Framework for Trustworthy Large Reasoning Models with Reliability, Faithfulness, and Interpretability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>:
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Problem interpretation</span> <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Extract conditions</span> <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Outline strategy</span> <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Derive step by step</span> <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">State result</span> <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reliability check</span>.
For all sections we run the model in <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.10" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">non-thinking</em> mode to maximize instruction following, except for <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Derive step by step</span>, where we enable <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.12" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">thinking</em> mode to leverage full reasoning capacity for the main derivation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> ReFIne SFT data collection with Qwen3-8B</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
                
                
              Problem text <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext='history\leftarrow""' display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>"</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>"</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">history\leftarrow""</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> accumulates prior sections with blank-line separators
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ProblemInterpretation}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Qwen3-8B</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ProblemInterpretation</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>mode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">non-thinking</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ProblemInterpretation}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="history\leftarrow U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">history\leftarrow U</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ExtractConditions}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Qwen3-8B</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ExtractConditions</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>mode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">non-thinking</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ExtractConditions}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mo fence="false" lspace="0.778em">|</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{OutlineStrategy}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Qwen3-8B</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">OutlineStrategy</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>mode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">non-thinking</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{OutlineStrategy}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F\ \|\ P" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F\ \|\ P</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="rawT\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{DeriveStepByStep}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{thinking})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Qwen3-8B</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">DeriveStepByStep</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>mode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">thinking</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">rawT\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{DeriveStepByStep}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{thinking})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> main derivation in thinking mode
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T\leftarrow\textsc{SubstringBetween}(rawT,\ \texttt{&lt;think&gt;},\ \texttt{&lt;/think&gt;})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SubstringBetween</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">&lt;think&gt;</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">&lt;/think&gt;</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T\leftarrow\textsc{SubstringBetween}(rawT,\ \texttt{&lt;think&gt;},\ \texttt{&lt;/think&gt;})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="after\_think\leftarrow\textsc{SubstringAfter}(rawT,\ \texttt{&lt;/think&gt;})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SubstringAfter</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">&lt;/think&gt;</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">after\_think\leftarrow\textsc{SubstringAfter}(rawT,\ \texttt{&lt;/think&gt;})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="FA\leftarrow\texttt{&lt;final\_answer&gt;}\ \|\ \textsc{Strip}(after\_think)\ \|\ \texttt{&lt;/final\_answer&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">&lt;final_answer&gt;</mtext><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Strip</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">&lt;/final_answer&gt;</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">FA\leftarrow\texttt{&lt;final\_answer&gt;}\ \|\ \textsc{Strip}(after\_think)\ \|\ \texttt{&lt;/final\_answer&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F\ \|\ P\ \|\ T\ \|\ FA" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">history\leftarrow U\ \|\ F\ \|\ P\ \|\ T\ \|\ FA</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
                
                
              <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ReliabilityCheck}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Qwen3-8B</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ReliabilityCheck</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>mode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">non-thinking</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\leftarrow\text{Qwen3-8B}(\textsc{ReliabilityCheck}(q,\,history),\ \text{mode}=\texttt{non-thinking})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
                
                
              <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(U,F,P,T,FA,S)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(U,F,P,T,FA,S)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Note.</em> The <span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;final_answer&gt;</span> block is produced directly from <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="rawT" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">rawT</annotation></semantics></math> by taking <em id="A1.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">everything</em> the model outputs <em id="A1.SS1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">after</em> the closing <span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/think&gt;</span> tag; no separate prompt is used.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Now we present the full prompt templates. In every case, <span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">problem</span> denotes the original question text, while <span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">history</span> is the <em id="A1.SS1.p3.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">concatenation of all previously generated sections</em>, joined with blank lines, ensuring that later blocks are explicitly grounded in earlier commitments.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Problem interpretation (<span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;understanding&gt;...&lt;/understanding&gt;</span>)</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
