<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Prompting QwQ-32B to Judge Reasoning Readability</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As stated in Section <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Interpretability ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ ReFIne: A Framework for Trustworthy Large Reasoning Models with Reliability, Faithfulness, and Interpretability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, we use QwQ-32B as a readability <em id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">auditor</em> to compare traces from <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ReFIne</span> and <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Plain</span>. The full prompt is shown below. The placeholder <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{question}</span> is the problem text and <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{response}</span> is the model’s full reasoning to be evaluated.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx99" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx99.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx99.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx99.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx99.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx99.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx99.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx99.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**</span><span id="lstnumberx99.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">readability</span><span id="lstnumberx99.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx99.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">judge</span><span id="lstnumberx99.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**.</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx100" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx100.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Your</span><span id="lstnumberx100.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">single</span><span id="lstnumberx100.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">task</span><span id="lstnumberx100.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx100.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx100.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">compare</span><span id="lstnumberx100.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx100.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">two</span><span id="lstnumberx100.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">model</span><span id="lstnumberx100.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasonings</span><span id="lstnumberx100.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx100.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">and</span><span id="lstnumberx100.22" class="ltx_te