<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Prompting QwQ-32B to Judge Commitment Faithfulness</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As stated in Section <a href="#S4.SS2" title="4.2 Faithfulness ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ ReFIne: A Framework for Trustworthy Large Reasoning Models with Reliability, Faithfulness, and Interpretability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>, we use QwQ-32B to check whether the derivation in <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;think&gt;</span> faithfully follows the model’s own prior commitments (<span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;understanding&gt;</span>, <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;facts&gt;</span>, and <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;plan&gt;</span>). The full prompt is shown below. The placeholder <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{question}</span> is the problem text and <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{reasoning}</span> is the full reasoning trace to be evaluated.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx135" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx135.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx135.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx135.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx135.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**</span><span id="lstnumberx135.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">structural</span><span id="lstnumberx135.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx135.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">auditor</span><span id="lstnumberx135.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**.</span><span id="lstnumberx135.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Compare</span><span id="lstnumberx135.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx135.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">‘&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx135.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">think</span><span id="lstnumberx135.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;...&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx135.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">think</span><span id="lstnumberx135.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;‘</span><span id="lstnumberx135.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">text</span><span id="lstnumberx135.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">with</span><span id="lstnumberx135.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx135.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">contents</span><span id="lstnumberx135.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">of</span><span id="lstnumberx135.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">‘&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx135.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">understanding</span><span id="lstnumberx135.37" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;...&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx135.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">understanding</span><span id="lstnumberx135.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;‘,</span><span id="lstnumberx135.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.41" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">‘&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx135.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">facts</span><span id="lstnumberx135.43" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;...&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx135.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">facts</span><span id="lstnumberx135.45" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;‘,</span><span id="lstnumberx135.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">and</span><span id="lstnumberx135.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx135.49" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">‘&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx135.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">plan</span><span id="lstnumberx135.51" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;...&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx135.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">plan</span><span id="lstnumberx135.53" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;‘.</span>
</div>
